## Diagram 3: Dual-Capital Production Structure

```
Task-level Production:

Cognitive task i in C:
  y_t(i) = [ (1-alpha_C,i) (A_L,t l_t(i))^((sigma_C-1)/sigma_C)
             + alpha_C,i (A_C,t k_C,t(i))^((sigma_C-1)/sigma_C) ]^(sigma_C/(sigma_C-1))

Physical task i in P:
  y_t(i) = [ (1-alpha_P,i) (A_L,t l_t(i))^((sigma_P-1)/sigma_P)
             + alpha_P,i (A_P,t k_P,t(i))^((sigma_P-1)/sigma_P) ]^(sigma_P/(sigma_P-1))

Interpersonal task i in I:
  y_t(i) = A_L,t l_t(i)

Embodiment mapping for physical tasks:
  alpha_P,i = Phi(rho_i, tau_robotics) = 1 / (1 + exp[-phi_0 - phi_1 rho_i - phi_2 tau_robotics])

Aggregate output:
  Y_t = [ integral_0^1 y_t(i)^((epsilon-1)/epsilon) di ]^(epsilon/(epsilon-1))

Aggregate labor share (Proposition 1):
  s_L,t = N_t X_t / (N_t X_t + A_C,t Z_C,t + A_P,t Z_P,t)

  where N_t = 1 - A_C,t - A_P,t + n_t
        A_j,t = m_j,t d_j,t
        X_t = (w_t / A_L,t)^(1-sigma)
        Z_j,t = (r_j,t / A_j,t)^(1-sigma)
```

