## Diagram 9: Timeline of Automation and Reinstatement

```
Time t -------------------------------------------------------------------------->

Phase 1: Cognitive Automation
  - m_C,t d_C,t rises
  - L_C,t falls
  - L_I,t rises (reallocation)
  - n_t rises (reinstatement R&D)
  - s_L,t falls but bounded

Phase 2: Embodied Automation
  - m_P,t d_P,t rises
  - L_P,t falls
  - L_I,t absorbs displaced workers
  - Absorption capacity kappa_I L_bar may bind
  - If D_C + D_P > kappa_I L_bar, structural unemployment U_t* > 0

Phase 3: Full Automation (limit)
  - m_C d_C + m_P d_P -> 1
  - N_t -> n_t
  - s_L,t -> s_L,I + s_L,n
  - If I is also automated, s_L,t -> 0
  - Fiscal capacity depends on tau_K, theta_W
```



